{"availability":"available","full":"Devisri-B/Agentic_RAG_Knowledge_Search","name":"Agentic_RAG_Knowledge_Search","description":"A production-ready AI Microservice that uses an Agentic Router to intelligently decide between retrieving answers from user provided documents (RAG) or searching the live web and does self-Evaluation","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2025-10-01T14:26:17Z","updated":"2026-06-01T02:58:24Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Devisri515/Agentic_RAG_Knowledge_Search","topics":["docker","faiss","fastapi","gradio","langgraph"],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Devisri515/Agentic_RAG_Knowledge_Search","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:09.243Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:09.243Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:09.243Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T22:34:09.243Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An agentic RAG assistant that decides where to find an answer (your uploaded documents or the live web), then scores its own answer for hallucinations, all running on free/CPU infrastructure.","Built with LangGraph, FastAPI, Gradio, FAISS, Google Gemini, and Docker.","🔗 Live Demo on HuggingFace Spaces » : bring your own free Gemini key and try it."],"features":["Self-evaluating: each response is scored for faithfulness (hallucination detection via NLI), answer relevance, and optional accuracy, computed locally and shown live in the UI.","Hallucination detection that works: it uses natural-language entailment, not just embedding similarity, so it catches answers that contradict the source (which cosine similarity misses).","Runtime document upload: drop in PDF, DOCX, TXT, MD, or CSV files; they're indexed instantly and searched first.","Conversational memory: follow-up questions resolve correctly, and older turns are auto-summarized to bound token cost in long chats.","Bring Your Own Key (BYOK): each user supplies their own Gemini key, so the public demo costs the owner nothing and never exhausts a shared quota."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Devisri-B/Agentic_RAG_Knowledge_Search/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"1445a8da231f9b9f1c60f984d6d55e2daf1eeb175a91011494cbb3c028dd108d","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:09.399Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:09.399Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An agentic RAG assistant that decides where to find an answer (your uploaded documents or the live web), then scores its own answer for hallucinations, all running on free/CPU infrastructure.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Devisri-B/Agentic_RAG_Knowledge_Search/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"optional","text":"Prerequisites: Python 3.10+, a free Google Gemini API key, Docker (optional).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Devisri-B/Agentic_RAG_Knowledge_Search/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"No API-key secret is required: the app uses BYOK, so each visitor enters their own Gemini key in the UI.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Devisri-B/Agentic_RAG_Knowledge_Search/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"1445a8da231f9b9f1c60f984d6d55e2daf1eeb175a91011494cbb3c028dd108d","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Devisri-B/Agentic_RAG_Knowledge_Search/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:09.399Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-06-01T02:58:24Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Devisri-B/Agentic_RAG_Knowledge_Search/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:09.400Z","hash":"1445a8da231f9b9f1c60f984d6d55e2daf1eeb175a91011494cbb3c028dd108d","originalBytes":9276,"storedBytes":9276,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["answer","agent","key","api","gemini","rag","docker","memory","evaluation","nli","own","faiss","faithfulness","files","upload","accuracy","each","huggingface